{"verse_key": "2:243", "surah": 2, "verse": 243, "text_uthmani": "۞ أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ خَرَجُوا۟ مِن دِيَـٰرِهِمْ وَهُمْ أُلُوفٌ حَذَرَ ٱلْمَوْتِ فَقَالَ لَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ مُوتُوا۟ ثُمَّ أَحْيَـٰهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَذُو فَضْلٍ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَشْكُرُونَ", "translation": "Have you not considered those who left their homes in many thousands, fearing death? Allāh said to them, \"Die\"; then He restored them to life. And Allāh is the possessor of bounty for the people, but most of the people do not show gratitude.", "verse_from_ms": 5791900, "verse_to_ms": 5819620, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/2.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "۞", "start_ms": 5791900, "end_ms": 5793530}, {"i": 1, "text": "أَلَمْ", "start_ms": 5793530, "end_ms": 5794800}, {"i": 2, "text": "تَرَ", "start_ms": 5794800, "end_ms": 5795160}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 5795160, "end_ms": 5795540}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 5795540, "end_ms": 5796490}, {"i": 5, "text": "خَرَجُوا۟", "start_ms": 5796490, "end_ms": 5797310}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 5797310, "end_ms": 5798170}, {"i": 7, "text": "دِيَـٰرِهِمْ", "start_ms": 5798170, "end_ms": 5799330}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَهُمْ", "start_ms": 5799330, "end_ms": 5799920}, {"i": 9, "text": "أُلُوفٌ", "start_ms": 5799920, "end_ms": 5800790}, {"i": 10, "text": "حَذَرَ", "start_ms": 5800790, "end_ms": 5801430}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْمَوْتِ", "start_ms": 5801430, "end_ms": 5802210}, {"i": 12, "text": "فَقَالَ", "start_ms": 5802210, "end_ms": 5803080}, {"i": 13, "text": "لَهُمُ", "start_ms": 5803080, "end_ms": 5803600}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 5803600, "end_ms": 5804650}, {"i": 15, "text": "مُوتُوا۟", "start_ms": 5804650, "end_ms": 5805140}, {"i": 16, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 5805140, "end_ms": 5806180}, {"i": 17, "text": "أَحْيَـٰهُمْ", "start_ms": 5806180, "end_ms": 5808080}, {"i": 18, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 5808080, "end_